a il massacro, poi con la forza prende la donna del suo capo Mara come sua. La via surreale di El Topo è sanguinaria, sessuale e auto-riflessiva, medita sui suoi stessi demoni, mentre cerca di sconfiggere quelli che incontra.","tagline":"Il cult western definitivo."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"El Topo decides to confront warrior Masters on a trans-formative desert journey he begins with his 6 year old son, who must bury his childhood totems to become a man.","tagline":"The definitive cult spaghetti western"},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"En un Oeste imaginario, el pistolero Topo se enfrenta a una banda de fetichistas, dirigida por un coronel lascivo, que tiene atemorizada a una congregación franciscana. Singular y provocativa película de culto, mezcla de géneros y movimientos culturales. John Lennon dijo de ella que era una obra maestra."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Oy7DY0i5ISfTaPtX8XaVHRq6wj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkfXO0Zswvvlbs0FlxH3TA4qji3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":13041,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Oy7DY0i5ISfTaPtX8XaVHRq6wj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Oy7DY0i5ISfTaPtX8XaVHRq6wj.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Oy7DY0i5ISfTaPtX8XaVHRq6wj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Oy7DY0i5ISfTaPtX8XaVHRq6wj.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7sIQlJgQ29ADkvOEdwrRDjYuoVl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7sIQlJgQ29ADkvOEdwrRDjYuoVl.jpg","language":"it","width":1563,"height":2346},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6jZNGPoY